CONTENTS. This repository contains: a hardware-realization paper (paper/), a
WYSIWYG ternary-circuit simulator (index.html), a SPICE cell library and
testbench (spice/), a gdsfactory layout generator (layout/), and an IEEE-style
manuscript (manuscript/). The device models in spice/models are illustrative
placeholders, not silicon-calibrated; no measured silicon is claimed.

